IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-time`
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-application`

-- Direct tests of functions that the pass-1 tests reach only through a local helper or through their callers, so that the coverage table can name a test
-- for each of them. Each expected value was decided from Schedule 2 (Part I paras 1 to 3, Part II para 6) and sections 4 and 23(1), not from the module.


